# Where tau-admin-server is reachable. Empty (the default) assumes same-origin - the recommended
# deployment shape is a reverse proxy serving this bundle and proxying /login, /api/*, etc. to
# tau-admin-server on one origin, so there's no cross-origin request at all and
# TAU_ADMIN_ALLOWED_ORIGINS on that service can stay empty too.
VITE_ADMIN_API_BASE=http://localhost:8100
